
@startuml
title Assignment 3 - Weather App Activity Diagram

start

:Launch weather_app.py;

:Parse command-line arguments;

:Select Colorado city;

:Look up city coordinates;

:Create or retrieve WeatherManager Singleton;

:Call get_weather();

:Build Open-Meteo API request;

:Send HTTPS request;

if (API request succeeds?) then (Yes)
    :Read JSON response;
    :WeatherAdapter converts API data;

    if (Weather data is valid?) then (Yes)
        :Create WeatherReading object;
        :Create Rich WeatherDashboard;
        :Build weather table and panel;
        :Display current weather;
    else (No)
        :Raise data conversion error;
    endif

else (No)
    :Raise weather request error;
endif

stop
@enduml
